From: Wisbendji Fimerlus <archledger236@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 11:17:07 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] effect: Apply offscreen view opacity to its scene item

Offscreen Quick windows have no platform window, so their opacity does
not reach the compositor through Qt. Forward opacity explicitly to the
scene item and exclude translucent view content from opaque regions.

Cover opacity changes, repainting, background damage, and EffectFrame
opacity with a native regression test.

Signed-off-by: Wisbendji Fimerlus <archledger236@gmail.com>
